<item>
<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-10-23T13:39:58.758Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 13:39:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;El Salvador has deployed elite forces to Haiti to rescue four kidnapped aviation technicians and four Salvadoran soldiers abducted by Haitian gangs in an ambush. President Bukele has warned the gangs of a harsh response if further attacks occur. The operation marks a direct foreign military intervention in the ongoing gang-state conflict in Port-au-Prince. Displacement continues, with recent reports of people fleeing armed violence in the communes of Petite Rivière de l'Artibonite and Arcahaie. The conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPaUVfcHo5QnJBR1pkQ0swOEcxQnZYQW9uLXVxWURpUkUxdGhwOXhsSXNWd0g2NGdzd2FmQVY2Wk5YcjZtSS1TWXVvNEJ4N2NmMGN4M21RS2E1UlJ3NFBCMlAzcVJxWGxOdDcyRXE3MHluMzJ5ZHhGblNaV3RTSVVLYUpkb2xRdHZJUFVmNW1mQlQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQQ202dHdUU3ViV0c5Um5fdEZrcHVuUjlfOTZZdk1oeHluT3JpbHNZWVJzcW43WDF6N01wSGRNOGlDSDc2YmU4WEJkb3J3STloOW9VdmVtRFFnSUlHRHp1YzA0cTlObXpZLXFQY2NrWkktejV1Qm9femlEZUpfVFVfMnZBODBPQXREYjg2WUVwSW02eWltM2hhdW1JTHRMVEtYVTZpVjFnZ1loNFNHdEtvcEw0dERqNHdyV3FTdQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxNSmZUWkw0Tk9Bd3RqLXVybXF6aXRCWFNDVGtqNnk0Z2hkb3lKa1FySTVaNU5oZHpGWjNZUVNnRnpVcmdPWmdwdmJNN2JNTExJUDlRV2F2czZGTlFWZ1ZiS2NKc0VzOVlzMXJVMDVCbEpzSXdTbFgxWjZDQ19OWW1MMw?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxQVTYwUzdKWnhqWWhWY2RVNVNJb054Y1JNN3pYZVRqZXR0Y2dHZGU0TFRQc0YxdE9mRUt0VUdvUXlHRGhaZ2Z1bkpERmxDcFNLa2U4QlRsakoyWnZzT1ZmRjBCV2xDX3MtTzVHRFNCR3FOLThCMmNhZ1BzUm1uaUwwVHRIZVA4bXBQdXI3VWVhWmlfaHF1d0FVRlpVakpCUVoyU3hTelVoZXdX